change_type: instructions   changelog: **Market data: now supports extended hours fields for real-time stock/ETF quotes, and offers a new fundamentals endpoint.**  - Real-time `/asset/{symbol}/live` endpoint now includes extended-hours fields: marketState, pre/post-market prices, changes, and session times. - New `/asset/{symbol}/details` endpoint provides in-depth fundamentals for stocks/ETFs, including profiles, financials, analyst ratings, and holdings. - Documentation updated with details on extended hours fields and the new fund

